      "problem": "Let $r=[\\begin{aligned}-3 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 7\\end{aligned}]$ and $s=[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ -2\\end{aligned}].$ Find the vector projection of $r$ onto $s.$\n\n${\\text{proj}}_{s}\\,r=⟨$ \n{{field-1}}$,$\n{{field-2}}$,$\n{{field-3}}\n$⟩$",
